		(property "Description_1" "The ESP8266-DEVKITC-02U-F from Espressif Systems is a  development board based on the ESP-WROOM-02U-N2 module, which integrates the ESP8266 Wi-Fi SoC. This board offers 17 GPIO pins for a wide range of functions, including HSPI, PWM, IR, I/O, ADC, UART, I2S, and I2C. It also supports a U.FL IPEX antenna for improved wireless connectivity. The ESP8266-DEVKITC-02U-F is designed for IoT applications, providing robust interfacing options for wireless communication and sensor integration. Additionally, the board features a USB interface for easy programming and debugging, making it ideal for prototyping Wi-Fi-enabled devices and projects."
			(at 96.52 97.79 0)
			(effects
